{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><h1>飛鵝山自殺崖攀石意外 中年漢墮崖昏迷 同行朋友受傷雙雙送院</h1><p>更新時間：19:34 2026-10-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:35 2026-10-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:35 2026-10-02 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/3c15d3e2e15df1a872e6c02f9ee9506f/2026-10/006.png\"><p>飛鵝山懷疑有人墮崖。今日（2日）下午2時36分，一名男子向警方報案，指他與另一名年約50歲男同事到飛鵝山攀石，其間男同事失足墮崖，身體雖繫有攀石繩，惟看不到他墮崖後情況，未知其傷勢。</p><img alt=\"一名中年男子攀石期間墮崖，送院時仍陷昏迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9537969b1e98b9971b85c6c0211c1009/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_19_13_19.jpeg\"><img alt=\"同行的同事受傷，清醒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/07f4eaa99bff2103cd964dc1152e881c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_19_12_00.jpeg\"><img alt=\"直升機將傷者救起，再送往醫院搶救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/31c07cabb413667af680b2d5981ac760/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_18_46_50_1_.jpeg\"><img alt=\"直升機將傷者救起，再送往醫院搶救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/44fce0e242d1429c7f93f185422f6146/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_18_46_50.jpeg\"><img alt=\"直升機將傷者救起，再送往醫院搶救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/90bf0cc70be4717ba82f0bf39dd6f527/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_18_55_01.jpeg\"><p>消防接報到場，由山徑徒步往自殺崖搜索事主，而政府飛行服務隊亦派出直升機在空中盤旋搜救。至下午5時，消防員在崖邊游繩救援，發現男子蹤影，但初步昏迷不醒，同行的同事亦告受傷，幸仍然清醒。直到傍晚6時半左右，直升機將二人救起，再送往醫院搶救。消息指，二人為休班救護員。</p><img alt=\"消防員在崖邊游繩救援，但一直未有發現。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e9bca6b224d055ccf461a50d46fdc15a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_17_07_56.jpeg\"><img alt=\"消防員在崖邊游繩救援。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/808e58fe0d14fe8b021d7536b12e0cf4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_16_58_58.jpeg\"><img alt=\"直升機盤旋搜索墮崖男子。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a621e1f5d957559a32e94746c848ffa9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_16.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/fab219e8596a9e5b1ba08d01032c3825/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_16_1_.jpeg\"><img alt=\"直升機盤旋搜索墮崖男子。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0a8966f301130057c440908055cf9691/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_15_1_.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/812f1e13141b43600d9bdfb10a040ada/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_14.jpeg\"><img alt=\"消防及救護車到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ac29cb75b6f0a2c6d1154bc9bb43efa1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_16_2_.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7c1430eceb52ecdc41cb7843fd535826/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_13.jpeg\"><img alt=\"其中一隊消防由山徑往自殺崖搜索墮崖事主。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/eb732547234f4fb4cb0106909816b415/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_16_12_08.jpeg\"><img alt=\"消防員搜救事主。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/fffeea9d23b552ee81e92a1dcba85eb9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_16_29_44.jpeg\"><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T13:40:19.632827+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}